    "section_3E7RwE": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Wn3ULw": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Welcome to Lillie & Cohoe Hats</strong> where all our hat styles are hand-crafted to exacting standards in Canada. Adored by thousands and <a href=\"/pages/hat-shopping-tools/#ship\" title=\"/pages/hat-shopping-tools/#ship\">shipped world-wide</a>, our hats are considered by many to be one of the <a href=\"https://lillieandcohoe.com/\"><strong>best Canadian hat brands</strong></a> available online and in numerous hat boutiques across <a href=\"/pages/where-to-buy/#CA\" title=\"/pages/where-to-buy/#CA\">Canada</a> and the <a href=\"/pages/where-to-buy/#US\" title=\"/pages/where-to-buy/#US\">U.S.A.</a> For over 30 years, Lillie & Cohoe has hand-crafted hats in all the most popular <a href=\"https://www.lillieandcohoe.com/women-fall-winter-hats/\">styles for women</a> and <a href=\"https://www.lillieandcohoe.com/men-fall-winter-hats/\">men</a>.</p><p>From casual to elegant, our <a href=\"/collections/sale-women-spring-summer-hats\" title=\"Women's Spring & Summer Hat Sale\"><strong>spring and summer hats</strong></a> are perfectly at home at a tea party, shopping in Soho, on the golf course or at the beach. From buckets to broad brims, <a href=\"https://www.lillieandcohoe.com/wet-weather/\">rain-ready</a> to <a href=\"https://www.lillieandcohoe.com/lake-country/\">sun-soaked</a>, you will find a hat to compliment your style and in a size right for you and almost every style we produce packs down easily for care-free travel.</p><p>Our <a href=\"https://www.lillieandcohoe.com/women-fall-winter-hats/\"><strong>fall and winter hats</strong></a> are famous for their cozy fit and hidden ear cuffs. Crafted in faux fur, <a href=\"/collections/boiled-wool\" title=\"Boiled Wool\">boiled wool</a>, <a href=\"/collections/mohair\" title=\"Mohair\">mohair</a> and myriad other fine fabrics, you won’t find a more stylishly suitable addition to your wardrobe to stand up to the harshest winter weather. It’s just one more reason you’ll love your look in a Lillie & Cohoe hat.</p>",
            "width": "100%",
            "max_width": "none",
            "alignment": "left",
